[States act by their aims]: What a state does abroad follows from its aims.
    <+ [Small states cannot aim at everything]: No small state can seek unlimited aims.
        {about: [{state: small, aims: impossible}, {state: small, acts: bandwagon}]}
    <+ [Midpowers aim low]: Midpowers seek limited aims.
